{"slug":"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/fractions-decimals-percentages/","source":"students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/fractions-decimals-percentages.html","area":"students","kind":"content","title":"Fractions, Decimals & Percentages | Mathematics","description":"","subject":"mathematics","body":"<div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\">\n    <nav class=\"mb-4\"><a href=\"/students/subjects/mathematics/foundations/\" class=\"text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800 font-medium\"><span class=\"mi -arrow-left mr-2\" data-mi=\"arrow_back\">arrow_back</span>Back to Foundations</a></nav>\n    \n    <article class=\"content-card rounded-xl shadow-lg p-6 md:p-8\">\n      <header class=\"mb-6 border-b pb-4\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Fractions, Decimals &amp; Percentages</h1>\n        <p class=\"text-gray-600\">Master the essential skills of converting between fractions, decimals, and percentages - fundamental concepts for WAEC examination success.</p>\n      </header>\n\n      <!-- Learning Objectives -->\n      <div class=\"bg-blue-50 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-6\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -bullseye mr-2\" data-mi=\"adjust\">adjust</span>Learning Objectives</h3>\n        <ul class=\"text-sm text-blue-700 space-y-1\">\n          <li>• Convert between fractions, decimals, and percentages</li>\n          <li>• Perform calculations with fractions (addition, subtraction, multiplication, division)</li>\n          <li>• Calculate percentage increases and decreases</li>\n          <li>• Apply percentage to real-world problems (profit, loss, discount)</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Section 1: Understanding Fractions -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-green-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">1</span>\n          Understanding Fractions\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">A fraction represents a part of a whole. It consists of a numerator (top number) and denominator (bottom number).</p>\n        \n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4 text-center\">\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-2xl text-gray-800\">Numerator / Denominator</p>\n          <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2\">Example: 3/4 means \"3 parts out of 4 equal parts\"</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-green-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -divide mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Proper Fraction</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Numerator &lt; Denominator</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-lg mt-1\">e.g., 3/4, 2/5</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-yellow-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -greater-than mr-2\" data-mi=\"help_outline\">help_outline</span>Improper Fraction</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Numerator &gt; Denominator</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-lg mt-1\">e.g., 7/4, 11/5</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-blue-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-blue-200\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-blue-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -plus mr-2\" data-mi=\"add\">add</span>Mixed Number</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700\">Whole number + Fraction</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-lg mt-1\">e.g., 1¾, 2⅗</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-green-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Converting Improper Fractions to Mixed Numbers</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Convert 17/5 to a mixed number.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Divide numerator by denominator</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">17 ÷ 5 = 3 remainder 2</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Write as mixed number</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  Whole number = 3<br>\n                  Remainder = 2<br>\n                  Therefore: 17/5 = 3⅖\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 17/5 = 3⅖</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 2: Fraction Operations -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">2</span>\n          Fraction Operations\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-indigo-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-indigo-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -plus mr-2\" data-mi=\"add\">add</span>Addition &amp; Subtraction</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Find a common denominator first!</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded\">a/b + c/d = (ad + bc) / bd</p>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"bg-purple-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">\n            <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-purple-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -times mr-2\" data-mi=\"close\">close</span>Multiplication</h4>\n            <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 mb-2\">Multiply numerators and denominators</p>\n            <p class=\"font-mono text-sm bg-white p-2 rounded\">a/b × c/d = (a×c) / (b×d)</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-blue-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Adding Fractions</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Calculate 2/3 + 5/6</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Find common denominator (LCM of 3 and 6 = 6)</p>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Convert fractions</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  2/3 = 4/6 (multiply top and bottom by 2)<br>\n                  5/6 = 5/6 (already has denominator 6)\n                </div>\n                <p><strong>Step 3:</strong> Add numerators</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  4/6 + 5/6 = (4 + 5)/6 = 9/6 = 3/2 = 1½\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 2/3 + 5/6 = 1½</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example 2 -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-blue-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Dividing Fractions</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Calculate 3/4 ÷ 2/5</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Rule:</strong> To divide, multiply by the reciprocal (flip the second fraction)</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  3/4 ÷ 2/5 = 3/4 × 5/2<br>\n                  = (3 × 5) / (4 × 2)<br>\n                  = 15/8<br>\n                  = 1⅞\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 3/4 ÷ 2/5 = 1⅞</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 3: Decimals -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-purple-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">3</span>\n          Decimals and Conversions\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Decimals are another way to represent parts of a whole. They are based on powers of 10.</p>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <p class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Converting Fractions to Decimals:</p>\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-center text-lg\">Divide the numerator by the denominator</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n            <p class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded text-center\">1/2 = 1 ÷ 2 = <strong>0.5</strong></p>\n            <p class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded text-center\">3/4 = 3 ÷ 4 = <strong>0.75</strong></p>\n            <p class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded text-center\">1/3 = 1 ÷ 3 = <strong>0.333...</strong> (repeating)</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -exchange-alt text-purple-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"swap_horiz\">swap_horiz</span>Converting Decimals to Fractions</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: Convert 0.375 to a fraction in its simplest form.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Write as fraction over power of 10</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">0.375 = 375/1000</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Simplify by dividing by common factors</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  375/1000 = 75/200 (÷5)<br>\n                  = 15/40 (÷5)<br>\n                  = 3/8 (÷5)\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 0.375 = 3/8</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Section 4: Percentages -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"bg-orange-500 text-white rounded-full w-8 h-8 flex items-center justify-center mr-3 text-sm\">4</span>\n          Percentages\n        </h2>\n        \n        <p class=\"text-gray-700 mb-4\">Percent means \"per hundred\". The symbol % means \"out of 100\".</p>\n\n        <div class=\"bg-gray-100 p-4 rounded-lg mb-4\">\n          <p class=\"font-semibold text-gray-800 mb-2\">Key Conversions:</p>\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-2 text-center\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded\">Fraction → Decimal → Percentage</div>\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 grid md:grid-cols-4 gap-2 text-center text-sm\">\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded\"><strong>1/4</strong> = 0.25 = <strong>25%</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded\"><strong>1/2</strong> = 0.5 = <strong>50%</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded\"><strong>3/4</strong> = 0.75 = <strong>75%</strong></div>\n            <div class=\"bg-white p-2 rounded\"><strong>1/5</strong> = 0.2 = <strong>20%</strong></div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Percentage Increase/Decrease -->\n        <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 border-l-4 border-yellow-400 p-4 rounded-r-lg mb-4\">\n          <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-yellow-800 mb-2\"><span class=\"mi -chart-line mr-2\" data-mi=\"show_chart\">show_chart</span>Percentage Change Formula</h4>\n          <p class=\"font-mono text-center bg-white p-2 rounded\">% Change = (New Value - Original Value) / Original Value × 100</p>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Worked Example -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -calculator text-orange-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>Worked Example: Percentage Increase</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-3\">Problem: A shirt's price increased from ₦2,000 to ₦2,500. Find the percentage increase.</p>\n              <div class=\"space-y-2 text-gray-700\">\n                <p><strong>Step 1:</strong> Find the increase</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">Increase = 2,500 - 2,000 = ₦500</div>\n                <p><strong>Step 2:</strong> Calculate percentage</p>\n                <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono\">\n                  % Increase = (500 / 2,000) × 100<br>\n                  = 0.25 × 100<br>\n                  = 25%\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"text-green-600 font-semibold mt-2\"><strong>Answer:</strong> 25% increase</p>\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Profit and Loss -->\n        <div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-lg overflow-hidden mb-4\">\n          <button class=\"accordion-btn w-full flex items-center justify-between p-4 bg-gray-50 hover:bg-gray-100\">\n            <span class=\"font-semibold text-gray-700\"><span class=\"mi -balance-scale text-orange-500 mr-2\" data-mi=\"balance\">balance</span>Profit and Loss</span>\n            <span class=\"mi -chevron-down transition-transform\" data-mi=\"expand_more\">expand_more</span>\n          </button>\n          <div class=\"accordion-content\">\n            <div class=\"p-4 bg-white\">\n              <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-4\">\n                <div class=\"bg-green-50 p-3 rounded\">\n                  <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-green-800 mb-2\">Profit</h4>\n                  <p class=\"text-sm\">Selling Price &gt; Cost Price</p>\n                  <p class=\"font-mono text-sm mt-1\">Profit = SP - CP</p>\n                  <p class=\"font-mono text-sm\">% Profit = Profit/CP × 100</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-red-50 p-3 rounded\">\n                  <h4 class=\"font-semibold text-red-800 mb-2\">Loss</h4>\n                  <p class=\"text-sm\">Selling Price &lt; Cost Price</p>\n                  <p class=\"font-mono text-sm mt-1\">Loss = CP - SP</p>\n                  <p class=\"font-mono text-sm\">% Loss = Loss/CP × 100</p>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n              <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800 mb-2\">Example: A trader buys goods for ₦400 and sells for ₦500.</p>\n              <div class=\"bg-gray-50 p-3 rounded font-mono text-sm\">\n                Profit = 500 - 400 = ₦100<br>\n                % Profit = (100/400) × 100 = 25%\n              </div>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Interactive Calculator -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -calculator text-teal-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"calculate\">calculate</span>\n          Interactive Percentage Calculator\n        </h2>\n        <div class=\"bg-teal-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-teal-200\">\n          <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-4 mb-4\">\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">Original Value</label>\n              <input type=\"number\" id=\"origValue\" value=\"200\" class=\"w-full p-2 border rounded\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">Percentage</label>\n              <input type=\"number\" id=\"percentValue\" value=\"15\" class=\"w-full p-2 border rounded\">\n            </div>\n            <div>\n              <label class=\"block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1\">Operation</label>\n              <select id=\"percentOp\" class=\"w-full p-2 border rounded\">\n                <option value=\"of\">% of value</option>\n                <option value=\"increase\">Increase by %</option>\n                <option value=\"decrease\">Decrease by %</option>\n              </select>\n            </div>\n          </div>\n          <button class=\"w-full bg-teal-600 text-white py-2 rounded hover:bg-teal-700 transition\">Calculate</button>\n          <div id=\"percentResult\" class=\"mt-3 p-3 bg-white rounded text-center font-semibold text-lg\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Practice Problems -->\n      <section class=\"mb-8\">\n        <h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 flex items-center\">\n          <span class=\"mi -pencil-alt text-orange-500 mr-3\" data-mi=\"edit\">edit</span>\n          Practice Problems\n        </h2>\n        \n        <div class=\"space-y-4\">\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">1. Convert 5/8 to a decimal.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice1\" placeholder=\"Your answer\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback1\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">2. Increase 80 by 15%.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice2\" placeholder=\"Your answer\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback2\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">3. Calculate: 2/3 ÷ 4/9</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice3\" placeholder=\"Your answer (as fraction)\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback3\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n\n          <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-4 rounded-lg border border-orange-200\">\n            <p class=\"font-medium text-gray-800\">4. Express 0.125 as a fraction in its simplest form.</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-3 flex gap-2\">\n              <input type=\"text\" id=\"practice4\" placeholder=\"e.g., 1/2\" class=\"flex-grow p-2 border rounded\">\n              <button class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-orange-500 text-white rounded hover:bg-orange-600\">Check</button>\n            </div>\n            <p id=\"feedback4\" class=\"mt-2 text-sm\"></p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n\n      <!-- Summary Table -->\n      <section class=\"bg-gradient-to-r from-green-100 to-teal-100 p-6 rounded-lg\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-bold text-gray-800 mb-3\"><span class=\"mi -clipboard-list mr-2\" data-mi=\"fact_check\">fact_check</span>Quick Reference Table</h3>\n        <div class=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n          <table class=\"w-full text-sm bg-white rounded-lg overflow-hidden\">\n            <thead class=\"bg-gray-100\">\n              <tr>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Fraction</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Decimal</th>\n                <th class=\"p-3 text-left\">Percentage</th>\n              </tr>\n            </thead>\n            <tbody>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">1/10</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.1</td><td class=\"p-3\">10%</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">1/5</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.2</td><td class=\"p-3\">20%</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">1/4</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.25</td><td class=\"p-3\">25%</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">1/3</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.333...</td><td class=\"p-3\">33⅓%</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">1/2</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.5</td><td class=\"p-3\">50%</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">2/3</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.666...</td><td class=\"p-3\">66⅔%</td></tr>\n              <tr class=\"border-t\"><td class=\"p-3\">3/4</td><td class=\"p-3\">0.75</td><td class=\"p-3\">75%</td></tr>\n            </tbody>\n          </table>\n        </div>\n      </section>\n    </article>\n  </div>\n\n  \n<!-- Topic Quiz System -->","bodyClass":"min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-green-50 to-teal-100 p-6","bodyStyle":"","css":["body{font-family:Inter, sans-serif}.content-card{-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(12px);backdrop-filter:blur(12px);background:rgba(255,255,255,0.9);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);} .accordion-content{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;transition:max-height 0.3s ease-out;}.accordion-content.open{max-height:2000px;}"],"quiz":null,"tracker":null,"links":[]}